    "source": "KIT_BUDR_FULL.lsp (c:BUDR_FULL lines 607-800, CSV 914-965) + SKYLON_COMMON.lsp (drawBUL/drawBUR with runnerYList) \u2014 the SAME kit as golden-budr.json, with the front split changed and nothing else",
    "computed_by": "Claude (turn 12 autonomous session, 09.08.2026) from the LISP formulas as recorded in golden-budr.json budr_rules, NOT from the engine. The generator was validated by reproducing every field of BUDR-A and BUDR-B exactly before it was allowed to emit this file.",
    "status": "PENDING_PIOTR_VERIFICATION",
    "rule": "GOLDEN FIXTURES - DO NOT MODIFY. Tests must make these pass. If engine output differs, the ENGINE is wrong (or file a BLOCKERS.md entry). Never edit expected values to make tests green.",
    "units": "mm, m2, m"
  },
  "budr_rules": {
    "front_heights": "available = H - 2x3; fronts split 1:1 of it (LISP fix(x+0.5)), the LAST front taking whatever the rounding leaves so that sum(fronts) = available exactly \u2014 the kit's own invariant, stack top = H - 3. Fronts overlay the full carcass from the floor: F1 at y=0, gaps 3mm.",
    "front_width": "szerFRONT = W - 3 (all three fronts, overlay like a single door)",
    "drawer_depth": "maxDl = D - G - 20 (NOT the wardrobe formula); snap DOWN to {390,440,490,540,590,640,690}, floor 390",
    "box": "szufSzer = internalW - 10; side height = round(0.70 * front) \u2014 NOT front - 36; boxFront H = side - 15 - G - 1; boxFrontLen = W - 4G - 10; bottom = (boxFrontLen + 13) x szufDl",
    "runners": "both carcass sides, rows at [G+38, F1+3+38, F1+3+F2+3+38], holes x {37,69,293} from front edge (mirrored on BUR), layer RUNNERS_3MM",
    "front_screws": "2 holes 3mm per front on FRONT_HINGES_3MM: x = 50+2G+3.5 from each side edge, y = 96.5 (+G for drawer 1)",
    "side_pockets": "drawer side CNC (drawn rotated): DRAWER_RUNNER_POCKET strip x 0..15, DRAWER_BOTTOM_POCKET strip x 15..15+G+1, both overshooting 10mm past each end",
    "box_screws": "box FRONT only: 2x SCREWS_3MM at (50, 50) and (50, dlBoxFront-50) in drawn coords; bottoms: 4x SCREWS_3MM at x {70, szerDno-70}, y {9, dlDno-9}",
    "no_partition": "BUDR has NO partition above the drawer stack and NO shelves/doors/rail",
    "lisp_panel_count": "LISP totalPanels = 20 (5 carcass + 15 drawer parts) and the FRONTS summary counts the 3 drawer fronts SEPARATELY (L863, L882-888) \u2014 the opposite of KIT_WARDROBE_FULL, which counts drawer fronts inside totalPanels and doors separately. Invariant that holds for every kit: panels_lisp + fronts = every cut piece except the ones the kit knowingly omits.",
    "variant": "CLAUDE.md F3.2 \u2014 the 2x drawer unit. Two EQUAL deep drawers: 764/2 = 382 exactly, so nothing is left over and the last-front rule never fires."
  },
